{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_053","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Network issues preventing successful dependency installation","location_hint":"paragraph 118","char_start":5371,"char_end":5431,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_054","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"When problems involve Python environment interdependencies and versions, troubleshooting becomes more complex and requires knowledge of Python environment management, including how to install and uninstall dependencies","location_hint":"paragraph 119","char_start":5433,"char_end":5651,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_055","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Using Binary Search for Troubleshooting","location_hint":"paragraph 121","char_start":5660,"char_end":5699,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_056","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Among these two different types of custom node issues, conflicts between custom node frontend extensions and ComfyUI are more common. We’ll prioritize troubleshooting these nodes first. Here’s the overall troubleshooting approach:","location_hint":"paragraph 122","char_start":5701,"char_end":5931,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_057","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"1. Troubleshooting the Custom Nodes’ Frontend Extensions","location_hint":"paragraph 124","char_start":5940,"char_end":5996,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_058","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Disable All Third-Party Frontend Extensions","location_hint":"paragraph 126","char_start":6007,"char_end":6050,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_059","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"After starting ComfyUI, find the Extensions menu in settings and follow the steps shown in the image to disable all third-party extensions","location_hint":"paragraph 127","char_start":6052,"char_end":6190,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_060","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"If you can’t enter ComfyUI frontend, just skip the frontend extensions troubleshooting section and continue to General Custom Node Troubleshooting Approach","location_hint":"paragraph 128","char_start":6194,"char_end":6349,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_061","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"After disabling frontend extensions for the first time, it’s recommended to restart ComfyUI to ensure all frontend extensions are properly disabled","location_hint":"paragraph 131","char_start":6377,"char_end":6524,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_062","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"If the problem disappears, then it was caused by custom node frontend extensions, and we can proceed with binary search troubleshooting","location_hint":"paragraph 132","char_start":6526,"char_end":6661,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_063","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"If the problem persists, then it’s not caused by frontend extensions - please refer to the other troubleshooting approaches in this document","location_hint":"paragraph 133","char_start":6663,"char_end":6803,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_064","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Use Binary Search to Locate Problem Nodes","location_hint":"paragraph 135","char_start":6816,"char_end":6857,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_065","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Use the method mentioned at the beginning of this document to troubleshoot, enabling half of the custom nodes at a time until you find the problematic node Refer to the image to enable half of the frontend extensions. Note that if extension names are similar, they likely come from the same custom node’s frontend extensions","location_hint":"paragraph 136","char_start":6859,"char_end":7183,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_066","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"If you find the problematic custom node, please refer to the problem fixing section of this document to resolve the custom node issues","location_hint":"paragraph 139","char_start":7213,"char_end":7347,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_067","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Using this method, you don’t need to restart ComfyUI multiple times - just reload ComfyUI after enabling/disabling custom node frontend extensions. Plus, your troubleshooting scope is limited to nodes with frontend extensions, which greatly narrows down the search range.","location_hint":"paragraph 140","char_start":7349,"char_end":7620,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_068","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"2. General Custom Node Troubleshooting","location_hint":"paragraph 142","char_start":7629,"char_end":7667,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_069","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Use Binary Search to Locate Custom Nodes","location_hint":"paragraph 144","char_start":7678,"char_end":7718,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_070","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"For the binary search localization method, in addition to manual search, we also have automated binary search using comfy-cli, as detailed below:","location_hint":"paragraph 145","char_start":7720,"char_end":7865,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_071","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Using Comfy CLI requires some command line experience. If you’re not comfortable with it, use manual binary search instead. If you have Comfy CLI installed, you can use the automated bisect tool to find the problematic node:","location_hint":"paragraph 148","char_start":7924,"char_end":8148,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_072","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"# Start a bisect session\ncomfy-cli node bisect start","location_hint":"paragraph 149","char_start":8152,"char_end":8204,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_073","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"# Follow the prompts:\n# - Test ComfyUI with the current set of enabled nodes\n# - Mark as &#x27;good&#x27; if the issue is gone: comfy-cli node bisect good\n# - Mark as &#x27;bad&#x27; if the issue persists: comfy-cli node bisect bad\n# - Repeat until the problematic node is identified","location_hint":"paragraph 150","char_start":8206,"char_end":8489,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_074","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"# Reset when done\ncomfy-cli node bisect reset","location_hint":"paragraph 151","char_start":8491,"char_end":8536,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_075","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"The bisect tool will automatically enable/disable nodes and guide you through the process.","location_hint":"paragraph 152","char_start":8539,"char_end":8629,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_076","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Before starting, please create a backup of your custom_nodes folder in case something goes wrong.","location_hint":"paragraph 153","char_start":8633,"char_end":8730,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_077","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"If you prefer to do the process manually or don’t have Comfy CLI installed, follow the steps below:","location_hint":"paragraph 154","char_start":8732,"char_end":8831,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_078","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Before starting, enter the <YOUR_COMFYUI_FOLDER>\\ComfyUI\\ folder","location_hint":"paragraph 157","char_start":8868,"char_end":8932,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_079","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Backup all custom nodes : Copy and rename custom_nodes to custom_nodes_backup","location_hint":"paragraph 161","char_start":8975,"char_end":9052,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_080","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Create a temporary folder : Create a folder named custom_nodes_temp","location_hint":"paragraph 162","char_start":9054,"char_end":9121,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_081","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Or use the following command line to backup:","location_hint":"paragraph 163","char_start":9123,"char_end":9167,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_082","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"# Create backup and temporary folder\nmkdir \"%USERPROFILE%\\custom_nodes_backup\"\nmkdir \"%USERPROFILE%\\custom_nodes_temp\"","location_hint":"paragraph 164","char_start":9171,"char_end":9289,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_083","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"# Backup all content\nxcopy \"custom_nodes\\*\" \"%USERPROFILE%\\custom_nodes_backup \\\" /E /H /Y","location_hint":"paragraph 165","char_start":9291,"char_end":9381,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_084","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Manually backup custom_nodes folder\nOr use the following command line to backup:","location_hint":"paragraph 166","char_start":9384,"char_end":9464,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_085","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"# Create backup and temporary folder\nmkdir ~/custom_nodes_backup\nmkdir ~/custom_nodes_temp","location_hint":"paragraph 167","char_start":9468,"char_end":9558,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_086","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"# Backup all content\ncp -r custom_nodes/ * ~/custom_nodes_backup/","location_hint":"paragraph 168","char_start":9560,"char_end":9625,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_087","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"# Create backup and temporary folder\nmkdir /content/custom_nodes_backup\nmkdir /content/custom_nodes_temp","location_hint":"paragraph 169","char_start":9630,"char_end":9734,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_088","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"# Backup all content\ncp -r /content/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/ * /content/custom_nodes_backup/","location_hint":"paragraph 170","char_start":9736,"char_end":9825,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_089","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Since Windows has a visual interface, you can skip this step unless you’re only using the command line","location_hint":"paragraph 176","char_start":9899,"char_end":10001,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_090","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"ls /content/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/","location_hint":"paragraph 179","char_start":10047,"char_end":10080,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_091","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Let’s assume that you have 8 custom nodes. Move the first half to temporary storage:","location_hint":"paragraph 182","char_start":10113,"char_end":10197,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_092","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"# Move first half (nodes 1-4) to temp\nmove \"custom_nodes\\node1\" \"%USERPROFILE%\\custom_nodes_temp \\\"\nmove \"custom_nodes \\n ode2\" \"%USERPROFILE% \\c ustom_nodes_temp \\\"\nmove \"custom_nodes\\node3\" \"%USERPROFILE%\\custom_nodes_temp \\\"\nmove \"custom_nodes \\n ode4\" \"%USERPROFILE% \\c ustom_nodes_temp \\\"","location_hint":"paragraph 186","char_start":10240,"char_end":10533,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_093","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"# Move first half (nodes 1-4) to temp\nmv custom_nodes/node1 ~/custom_nodes_temp/\nmv custom_nodes/node2 ~/custom_nodes_temp/\nmv custom_nodes/node3 ~/custom_nodes_temp/\nmv custom_nodes/node4 ~/custom_nodes_temp/","location_hint":"paragraph 187","char_start":10538,"char_end":10747,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_094","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"# Move first half (nodes 1-4) to temp\nmv /content/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/node1 /content/custom_nodes_temp/\nmv /content/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/node2 /content/custom_nodes_temp/\nmv /content/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/node3 /content/custom_nodes_temp/\nmv /content/ComfyUI/custom_nodes/node4 /content/custom_nodes_temp/","location_hint":"paragraph 188","char_start":10752,"char_end":11057,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_095","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Issue persists : Problem is in the remaining nodes (5-8)","location_hint":"paragraph 195","char_start":11156,"char_end":11212,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_096","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Issue disappears : Problem was in the moved nodes (1-4)","location_hint":"paragraph 196","char_start":11214,"char_end":11269,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_097","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"If issue persists: Move half of remaining nodes (e.g., nodes 7-8) to temp","location_hint":"paragraph 199","char_start":11300,"char_end":11373,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_098","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"If issue gone: Move half of temp nodes (e.g., nodes 3-4) back to custom_nodes","location_hint":"paragraph 200","char_start":11375,"char_end":11452,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_099","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Repeat until you find the single problematic node","location_hint":"paragraph 202","char_start":11465,"char_end":11514,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
{"excerpt_id":"ex_aede2f10d470_100","source_id":"src_aede2f10d470","source_hash":"99f046b84b779e9549d51a16b78c66c1b2a0d1b6d2efae91a13a23aef1bf042d","text":"Repeat until you find the single problematic node","location_hint":"paragraph 203","char_start":11518,"char_end":11567,"origin":"raw_text","created_at":"2026-05-09T02:33:05.934Z"}
